'' ===========================================================================
''
''   File.......  ch02-hub-counters.spin2
''   Purpose....  Eight cogs running one routine, told apart only by the
''                hub address each was handed in PTRA
''   Manual.....  DeSilva PASM2 Tutorial Manual
''   Version....  v3.0.6 (2026-08-16)
''   Appears in.  Chapter 2: Architecture Safari -- Your Turn: Experiments
''   Authors....  Iron Sheep Productions, LLC
''   E-mail.....  stephen@ironsheep.biz
''   Started....  Jun 2026
''   Updated....  Jun 2026
''
''   This file is an EXAMPLE from the manual above. Everything below
''   this header is byte-identical to the listing printed there --
''   what you read in the manual is what builds here.
''
'' ===========================================================================

PUB main() | i
    repeat i from 0 to 7
        coginit(COGEXEC_NEW, @counter, $1000 + (i * 4))
    repeat
        ' Monitor the counters in hub RAM
        
DAT
        org     0
counter mov     hub_ptr, ptra          ' Our hub address arrived in PTRA
.loop   rdlong  value, hub_ptr
        add     value, #1
        wrlong  value, hub_ptr
        waitx   ##1_000_000
        jmp     #.loop
        
hub_ptr long    0
value   long    0

